    "updated_at": "2020-10-03T08:26:44Z",
    "body": "Hi @unindented, by default Starship tries to log to create log files in `~/.cache/starship`, see [logging docs](https://starship.rs/config/#logging) for more information. Can you check the permissions on that directory?\r\n\r\nWe should still handle that error more gracefully, Starship should not panic if we can't create the log directory.",
