    "updated_at": "2020-10-03T15:55:57Z",
    "body": "Ah, you're right. `chown -R $(whoami) ~/.cache` solved the issue.\r\n\r\nI suspect the latest macOS update (10.15.7) messed around with permissions on some folders. So it was that, and not the `starship` upgrade, that caused the issue.\r\n\r\nThank you!",
